@Gateway_HostAddress = https://localhost:7162

### Liste des produits (via Ocelot)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/apigateway/Products
Accept: application/json

### Un produit (via Ocelot)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/apigateway/Products/1
Accept: application/json

### Créer un produit (via Ocelot -> ProductsAPI -> RabbitMQ -> OrdersAPI)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/apigateway/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "prod12",
  "stockQte": 660,
  "price": 1500
}

### Liste des commandes (via Ocelot)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/apigateway/Orders
Accept: application/json

### Créer une commande (via Ocelot)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/apigateway/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderDate": "2026-11-17T10:00:00",
  "customerName": "Wael",
  "productId": 1
}
